<title>THAILAND: Thai grains discharges schedule for Dec 20.</title>
<headline>Thai grains discharges schedule for Dec 20.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent surveyors detailed grains discharges at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel	    Date of Arrival     Commodity	    Amount</p>
<p>Yick Kam	     Dec 4	   US soybean		47,500</p>
<p>J.Jessica	    Dec 10	  US wheat		   6,600</p>
<p>Louise Oldendroff  Dec 12	  US soymeal, soybean</p>
<p>					   US corn gluten	  50,000</p>
<p>Fu Gang Shan	 Dec 12	  ARG sunflower meal    12,650</p>
<p>Zuzu		   Dec 13	  ARG soymeal	     31,500</p>
<p>Arthur Stove	 Dec 20	  Australian wheat	23,459</p>
<p>Hai Lee		Jan 22	  Indian soymeal	  12,000</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
